  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mali - Women&#x2019;s Civic Engagement and Participation in Public Life</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen women&#x2019;s civic engagement and participation in public life by using tontines&#x2014;traditional savings groups&#x2014;as platforms for dialogue, learning, and collective action. The proposed project is being developed as a pilot phase to deliver core activities; i)creating safe and inclusive spaces for women ii) increasing their involvement in community decision-making, and iii) fostering partnerships with local radio stations and authorities through workshops and training.</narrative>
  </description>
